"bodies/feed-8cee74c3160c.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-22c2da10856a", "title": "Champions League opening data shows English dominance and too few shocks", "source": "Guardian Football", "author": "Andrew Beasley", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/sep/11/champions-league-opening-data-shows-english-dominance-and-too-few-shocks", "image_url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/38e5ddce4885dea928403fb76299428927a9310a/62_125_1044_835/master/1044.jpg?width=1200&height=630&quality=85&auto=format&fit=crop&precrop=40:21,offset-x50,offset-y0&overlay-align=bottom%2Cleft&overlay-width=100p&overlay-base64=L2ltZy9zdGF0aWMvb3ZlcmxheXMvdGctZGVmYXVsdC5wbmc&enable=upscale&s=8136f519afbbc84adb100335f369aa17", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Sports", "topic": "soccer", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Guardian Football", "Sports", "en", "soccer", "text", "投资", "旅行探店", "游戏", "科技"], "excerpt": "The 2026-27 Champions League is under way. There are still 126 matches to play until we know which 24 teams will feature in the knockout phase but that doesn’t", "published_at": "2026-09-11T13:29:16Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-22c2da10856a.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-e89b8f127579", "title": "特努斯回答一切，那个懂技术的苹果 CEO 回来了", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1679848?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6aa4c5c4bae6a.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "游戏", "爱范儿", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n前不久，John Ternus 刚刚迎来了自己接任苹果 CEO 后的首场秋季新品发布会。在这场备受瞩目的亮相中，苹果拿出了酝酿已久的折叠屏手机 iPhone Duo、首次搭载可变光圈技术的 iPhone 18 Pro / Pro Max，以及全新一代 Apple Watch 系列。\n\n发布会落幕后，Ternus", "published_at": "2026-09-12T08:30:04Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-e89b8f127579.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-d814df7cc7aa", "title": "讲讲 Duo 作为科技产品命名的前世今生", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "罗嘉阳", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1679899?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/387-360x153.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n「到底是 Ultra，还是 Duo？」早在苹果发布会开始前，折叠屏 iPhone 该叫什么，网上各种传闻满天飞。互联网上争议不断，我们编辑部里的小伙伴，也为此争得不可开交。\n\n随着新任 CEO 约翰・特努斯轻描淡写说出那句 「One more thing」——iPhone", "published_at": "2026-09-12T06:14:09Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-d814df7cc7aa.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-14b3653eea78", "title": "刚刚，Apple Watch 成为了苹果最新的 AI 硬件", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "罗嘉阳", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1679877?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/808-360x153.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "爱范儿", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n曾几何时，Apple Watch 和 AirPods 被苹果定义为「配件」类产品。但在今年，这个苹果面向 AI 转型的关键年，这些产品却扮演了前所未有般更重要的地位。没错，不只是 iPhone，连过去的配件，也要自我进化，成为「AI 硬件」。在刚刚结束的秋季新品发布会上，苹果带来了 Apple Watch S12", "published_at": "2026-09-12T06:08:51Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-14b3653eea78.json", "engagement": 200, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f244501c3089", "title": "华源期货孙伏鲲带你用衍生品工具重塑交易体系：从波段结构到期权增强的四维交易系统", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3780023", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/76b3f58c-b068-43a9-ace2-db9a0d90594e.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "2026年的市场，对投资者提出了更高要求：难的并不是没有行情，而是行情往往来得快、切换也快。\n\n\n过去那种“看对大方向、耐心持有就能获利”的交易习惯，在高波动与强分化并存的环境中，正变得越来越不够用。\n\n\n具体来看，贵金属在避险情绪与利率预期反复切换中，常出现突破关键位置后快速回撤的走势；\n\n\n原油则容易受到地缘消息连", "published_at": "2026-09-12T07:38:24Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f244501c3089.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-9dfabc937594", "title": "美股长牛背后有大小熊", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "国信证券荀玉根", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781629", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/content_default_13.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "旅行探店", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "核心结论：①1896-1982年美股高波动、牛熊切换频繁，82年后逐渐降波、牛长熊短，源于产业转型及长期资金入市。②1982年来美股长牛背后有大小熊，大熊市源于基本面恶化，股指跌幅超50%，盈利估值双杀，如00-02年、07-09年。③另有8次小熊市，主要源于事件催化，股指平均跌幅23.5%、平均耗时3.4个月。\n\n\n", "published_at": "2026-09-12T07:38:03Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-9dfabc937594.json", "engagement": 190, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-eec9aeb450ff", "title": "直击光博会！芯片、光引擎、设备密集上新", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "上海证券报", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781627", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/content_default_12.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "从800G迈向1.6T，光通信产业链正在迎来新一轮产品迭代。\n\n\n在第二十七届中国国际光电博览会（CIOE中国光博会）上，记者看到，从单波200G光通信电芯片、6.4T", "published_at": "2026-09-12T06:13:51Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-eec9aeb450ff.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-de4a24e00744", "title": "柴油价格历史性突破6美元！美国会放“出口管制”大招吗？", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781623", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/0d4e3c9b-c984-4e8b-aa96-1c152a0584ab.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "旅行探店", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "美国柴油零售价首次突破每加仑6美元，创下历史纪录，令能源驱动的通胀压力在中期选举前夕骤然升温，也将一个长期被视为\"下策\"的政策选项重新推至聚光灯下——限制乃至禁止美国成品油出口。\n\n\n据美国汽车协会（AAA）数据，全国柴油均价已达每加仑6.0556美元，加利福尼亚州价格更逼近8美元。与此同时，汽油价格也突破每加仑4美元", "published_at": "2026-09-12T04:02:17Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-de4a24e00744.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-13f5b28117bd", "title": "一支拖鞋军，正在改写中东格局", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "牛弹琴", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781622", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/731052d5-0e8e-485d-a476-4246d24bdacf.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "最近的中东，局势又陡然变化，正发生戏剧性的重大转折。\n\n\n我说的，还不是指美国和伊朗的对攻，也不是以色列大杀四方，更不是阿尔及利亚和阿联酋断交，而是也门胡塞武装最近的摧枯拉朽。\n\n\n简直是兵锋所指，所向披靡。\n\n\n一支装备简陋的拖鞋军，突然扭转战局，并正在改写整个中东的格局。\n\n\n看视频和图片，更是触目惊心。\n\n\n在广", "published_at": "2026-09-12T03:36:37Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-12T10:10:48Z", "body": "bodies/feed-13f5b28117bd.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c7ed1dc61b83", "title": "OpenAI推出Agents API公测版，将Codex背后的harness与基础设施向开发者开放", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wa